[{"title":"林户求明道堂诗二首 其二","author":"陈淳","text":"自从河洛发真筌，节目纲条已粲然。\n志若坚刚方可适，心如捍格决难诠。\n从头格物为当务，稳步求仁乃秘传。\n表里直须名副实，高标终不愧前贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20528,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"林户求明道堂诗二首 其一","author":"陈淳","text":"秉彝同是得天生，道在其中本自明。\n气为禀来微有蔽，欲因感处复多萌。\n磨砻须到十分粹，克治全教一味清。\n从此洞然无别体，真元辉露日光星。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20529,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"玩雪","author":"陈淳","text":"南人乍见此般奇，惊怪谁司妙化机。\n月里姮娥筛粉撒，云端仙子削琼飞。\n宝山瑶室随村峙，玉树银花夹道辉。\n造物襟怀真洒落，更无尘滓间纤微。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20530,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"修学扁大成殿门依敖教韵上赵寺丞","author":"陈淳","text":"育才为国寸心丹，修泮时闻锵八鸾。\n绿引沧溟循道入，青徘名第对门看。\n宸钩日焕龙蛇动，书阁云齐牛斗寒。\n末学幸陪芹藻豆，讵耽秋菊夕英餐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20531,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"祝杖投钱唐江","author":"陈淳","text":"尔自黄源岭，相从到上都。\n扶持千险阻，策掖万崎岖。\n凤沼波应煖，龙门路不迂。\n便须齐变化，霈泽济寰区。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20532,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赵守礼延入学陈伯跃有诗咏其事因和以复之","author":"陈淳","text":"赵学规模本自宏，师传敢背此心盟。\n追思严训昭如在，立誓终身笃所行。\n每患无成辜宿志，那知自鬻钓浮名。\n贤侯爱友交提奖，重我惭惶未见荣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20533,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送王子正赴赣倅 其一","author":"陈淳","text":"飞腾仙驭自漳滨，去去西隅指赣津。\n夹道宾僚方一际，满城老稚便皆春。\n正心诚意平生学，爱物亲民此日仁。\n只恐贰藩车未煖，紫泥催促贰皇钧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20534,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送王子正赴赣倅 其二","author":"陈淳","text":"昔日濂溪倅此州，施为洒落岂常俦。\n今承遗躅百馀载，又得当朝一隽流。\n诏世典刑应未泯，在民德化岂无求。\n发挥旧事重增焕，好与邦人作胜谋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20535,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送王子正宰长乐二首 其二","author":"陈淳","text":"君当民社戴星游，我玩箪瓢守故丘。\n袂自此分何所憾，学无与讲是吾忧。\n圣心未可窥觇得，道体难从寡陋求。\n鳞翼元无南北间，时推绪论发蒙不。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20536,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送王子正宰长乐二首 其一","author":"陈淳","text":"一阳天运复来亨，君子随时亦吉征。\n暂向三山濒海处，小驰百里爱人声。\n从知文物新长乐，便作弦歌旧武城。\n须信道行由此兆，牛刀指日宰寰瀛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20537,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送陈尉后之园 其二","author":"陈淳","text":"世论年来太不和，真真伪伪总偏颇。\n阳尊孔孟阴排斥，深怯周程浪诋诃。\n谁是横流坚立砥，类于入室反操戈。\n始终无负传心处，一片精刚要不磨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20538,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送陈尉后之园 其一","author":"陈淳","text":"岩邑崎岖俗最狞，君来谈笑自风生。\n平戎大策方微露，执讯奇功便立成。\n百里秋光瓜代及，九重春色笋班荣。\n金闺此去应无阻，好把胸中次第行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20539,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送廖婿林伯鲁东归南寺席中因举送王长乐诗伯鲁用后篇韵求教故复依其韵以别之","author":"陈淳","text":"良夜禅房款一游，义心相与重山丘。\n少陪文字赓酬乐，顿释胸怀鄙隐忧。\n我愧反身无寸得，君方努力勇前求。\n悬知日有新新益，还肯双鱼远寄不。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20540,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送滕教归二首 其二","author":"陈淳","text":"驿道芬菲春气柔，征蹄去去不容留。\n俯辞南国抠衣佩，直向端门拜冕旒。\n璧沼从知新训导，石渠旋复细刊雠。\n泽民致主渊源学，那或浮沉逐辈流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20541,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送滕教归二首 其一","author":"陈淳","text":"本是山林一陋蒙，何心驰骛利名中。\n只因尺檄来蓬户，故策驽才入藻宫。\n既尔薰陶知厚德，又于历练熟颓风。\n区区未饫高山仰，何事征蹄今已东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20542,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽王郎中五首 其五","author":"陈淳","text":"近甸勋劳著，中朝宠眷隆。\n召从宗正贰，躐进户曹郎。\n从橐方虚伫，生经遽不融。\n睪如岩下息，万古俨公宫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20543,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽王郎中五首 其四","author":"陈淳","text":"暮景孤高节，岩岩挺岁寒。\n松姿标雪岭，玉质照冰盘。\n一介应无取，纤毫不可干。\n老成视前辈，宜作典刑看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20544,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽王郎中五首 其三","author":"陈淳","text":"剖竹毗陵郡，乘轺古越城。\n活民均惠泽，报主一忠诚。\n强禦敛踪伏，奸欺束手清。\n至今诵遗爱，何日可忘情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20545,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽王郎中五首 其二","author":"陈淳","text":"壮岁登科甲，淹迟暮始通。\n闽中驰德政，赣上振儒风。\n药石王宫训，权衡璧水功。\n俨然遗躅在，谁不悼思公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20546,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽王郎中五首 其一","author":"陈淳","text":"早得名师友，渊源正不他。\n持身庄以重，接物简而和。\n游夏文章学，求由政事科。\n朝闻今可矣，为恨复云何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20547,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽孙少卿四首 其四","author":"陈淳","text":"福庆于人鲜比方，一生坦若履康庄。\n好逑得偶天官胄，嗣子能传月窟芳。\n寿入九龄光宝箓，服膺三品灿金章。\n始终可谓无遗憾，信矣荣归死不亡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20548,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽孙少卿四首 其三","author":"陈淳","text":"厚德天钟有异资，反身尤谨事操持。\n俭勤忠孝传家训，直谅忱恂获上知。\n正色嫉邪严莫犯，高标立懦屹难移。\n睪如香坂孤峰下，千载唯存笃行碑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20549,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽孙少卿四首 其二","author":"陈淳","text":"圣主更新大化年，趋朝正预拔茅连。\n青华上厕郎星列，近密光陪卿月联。\n垂蹑从班提从橐，遽萌归兴乞归田。\n至今士论追怀处，第诵南山景行篇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20550,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽孙少卿四首 其一","author":"陈淳","text":"自抛襕苧列簪绅，便展施为志获伸。\n剖竹三衢无警盗，乘轺两浙蔑冤民。\n居官清节冰壶凛，到处仁恩雨露春。\n历历典刑如在日，慕思遗爱几多人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20551,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽杨料院二首 其二","author":"陈淳","text":"恩沐贤关渥，名登桂籍荣。\n古田驰义勇，永福播仁声。\n料院从优选，朝阶即坦行。\n胡为成契阔，第尔哭铭旌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20552,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽杨料院二首 其一","author":"陈淳","text":"早识渊源正，从师事切磨。\n天姿纯不颣，世俗淡无波。\n庐墓诚于孝，刑家俭以和。\n自应仁者寿，命也奈之何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20553,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽萧知县二首 其二","author":"陈淳","text":"早擢儒科秀，旋驱仕路荣。\n平反东广幕，抚字桂阳城。\n选调方优脱，朝阶自坦行。\n如何中道处，遽尔辍千旌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20554,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽萧知县二首 其一","author":"陈淳","text":"资禀于人异，天钟自粹夷。\n怀才无表襮，制行绝瑕疵。\n孝比王祥笃，知机下惠遗。\n乡闾称厚德，已矣但长噫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20555,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽程推官二首 其二","author":"陈淳","text":"生质钟来厚，风流近古人。\n奉官常翼翼，居里复恂恂。\n甥侄诲犹子，夫妻敬若宾。\n噫嘻公不死，嗣世有簪绅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20556,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽程推官二首 其一","author":"陈淳","text":"壮岁声场屋，高年仅小行。\n鄫江夷暴迹，湟水雪冤情。\n节志冰壶洁，襟期玉井清。\n竟登泉石趣，勇去谢荣名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20557,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寓严陵学和邓学录相留之韵","author":"陈淳","text":"道为贤侯讲泮宫，渊源程子及周翁。\n路开正脉同归极，川障狂澜浪驾空。\n珍重前廊浑气合，督提后进要心通。\n圣门相与从容入，矩步规行不用匆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20558,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖斋对莲","author":"陈淳","text":"平湖花叶乱相撑，恰对幽斋小榻清。\n万绿浅深非作意，千红浓淡总无情。\n好观物态群嘉萃，从识乾元一理生。\n佔毕暇馀时与玩，会予心处有谁评。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20559,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答留粹中承奉求教之韵","author":"陈淳","text":"玉质虽精更用砻，切磋磨琢趣无穷。\n但于天理昭如视，何患私情众互攻。\n明善诚身为要诀，博文约礼是深功。\n从今日用培基处，敬道尤须彻始终。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20560,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"解职归题主簿轩壁","author":"陈淳","text":"偶然寓兴五山阴，可叹颓波日转深。\n鼓瑟齐门莫同调，舞韶郑侧鲜知音。\n归寻旧径扫新榻，从整遗编理素琴。\n惟有春秋知罪我，外馀横直一何心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20561,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丁未十月见梅一点","author":"陈淳","text":"清清一点玉，枯枝绝鲜鲜。\n历历霜林奇，未省有此妍。\n雅如哲君子，觉在群蒙先。\n揭之几案上，使我心洒然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20562,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三月十一夜纪候","author":"陈淳","text":"春光正浓二三月，气候不作春和柔。\n白昼炎炎若盛夏，半夜凄凄如老秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20563,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久不雨","author":"陈淳","text":"草庐卧龙目未开，岩溪作霖手未抬。\n苍生望望亦劳尔，霶霈甘泽从何来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20564,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"忆李友叔皓三首 其三","author":"陈淳","text":"初见即我赠，东京博雅堂。\n再见复我和，北窗小梅章。\n此物今只存，而人乃云亡。\n有时牵龙尾，浓磨发精光。\n恍惚金漆交，相与游翰场。\n间或展骚轴，熟玩题芬芳。\n嶙峋骨鲠语，犹能动刚肠。\n触物即君感，感物复君伤。\n藏之不敢轻，于以无君忘。\n嗟嗟岂无朋，知心鲜其当。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20565,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"忆李友叔皓三首 其二","author":"陈淳","text":"君资盖清湛，君气亦温暇。\n厌渠市利嚣，向我访清洒。\n卑渠世学陋，就我咨纯雅。\n肺肠无胶轕，襟怀悉倾写。\n谈义信即笃，不以吾言野。\n箴过听益敬，不以吾为讶。\n授之关洛编，昼夜阅不舍。\n窃喜得良朋，可与结仁社。\n同驱入德车，共策适善马。\n胡此会乖违，使我闻陋寡。\n嗟嗟今而后，讵见斯人者。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20566,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"忆李友叔皓三首 其一","author":"陈淳","text":"君居郭之东，我馆亦东郭。\n君已素我心，我未一君目。\n时初丙辰秋，一见洞轩腹。\n君即就我眠，我亦共君读。\n历代故史编，皇家新典牍。\n我猎未暇精，君记抑何博。\n寒灯窗窍红，明月庭阴绿。\n君举口不休，我听膝屡促。\n忆从半载馀，丽泽情方熟。\n胡为一别后，终天诀遽作。\n嗟嗟怀若人，重搅我心曲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20567,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丙辰十月见梅同感其韵再赋","author":"陈淳","text":"霜枝秃秃瘦，孤英自中鲜。\n出尘寒玉姿，熟视何清妍。\n端如仁者心，洒落万物先。\n浑无一点累，表里俱彻然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20568,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仙霞岭歌","author":"陈淳","text":"仙霞何事名仙霞，巅末得之神仙家。\n此山南来绝高峻，上插云表参天涯。\n群仙游宴绝顶上，不饮烟火汤与茶。\n朝餐赤霞吸其英，暮餐黄霞咀其华。\n日傲烟霞为洞府，不踏尘寰寸泥沙。\n后躅跻攀不可得，危梯峻级频咨嗟。\n高人欲解行者疲，掇作好语清而嘉。\n故取仙霞起人慕，非以仙霞为世誇。\n流传岁月浸久远，此意零落说又差。\n谓酌流霞固浅陋，谓著霞衣亦浮葩。\n我来登陟动幽趣，愧无洒落清襟怀。\n聊寓数言代岭记，未可例视为南华。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20569,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"四十","author":"陈淳","text":"孔子四十而不惑，孟子四十不动心。\n尔年已及德未就，可不汲汲痛自箴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20570,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失言戒","author":"陈淳","text":"言者身枢机，兴戎亦出好。\n既正且中节，吉祥以类和。\n正苟发不中，忤物立召祸。\n不可言而言，夫子戒勿道。\n言轻则招忧，子云亦辨早。\n龙门有明箴，恳恳岂欺我。\n尔素重所出，胡兹失太果。\n策驷非难追，噬脐悔自蹈。\n从今臭不同，谨谨三缄默。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20571,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用明师叔韵赠画工张子英","author":"陈淳","text":"虽凭缣素状仪容，的自毫心蕴妙锋。\n个个本来天所赋，随人变化有奇工。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20572,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用敖教所赠诗韵送行","author":"陈淳","text":"臞庵先生仙籍豪，固非尘中浪骼骨。\n挺特不随时世妆，那学儿女誇首髴。\n朅来龙江主文盟，炉锤广大无弃物。\n裁狂雕朽谁弗容，游刃三年不少?。\n野人掩关北溪曲，于道未能探丝忽。\n甘谢驰驱抱孤拙，反获优容免呵咄。\n纡轸衡茅过招邀，寘之学海沧流潏。\n道德渊源漫斟酌，理义刍豢饱齧龁。\n由堂赐室纵步蹑，渊鳞骞翼恣手捽。\n金篦刮瘼丹起废，万斛尘胸为一拂。\n要令龊龊矿璞姿，无或晶光向埋没。\n云何聚散不可常，征车已驾城东月。\n当今中原若角崩，曦娥薄蚀耀计孛。\n庙堂侧席急选用，英才讵复偏方屈。\n便起鸮林簉鹓行，感时怒竖冲冠发。\n整顿乾纲靖坤维，扶掖炎精夐熛欻。\n拯危直鼓济商楫，逢邪须奋击泚笏。\n挽回一气转洪钧，平地春雷百蛰出。\n雍容细旃讲唐虞，正鞸垂绅其弁突。\n抑均斯道觉斯民，何但诸王私荫樾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20573,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"名陈宪友清轩","author":"陈淳","text":"名轩何以清，惟有梅与竹。\n梅清清且白，竹清清更绿。\n雪蕊破清洒，霜操挺清肃。\n至哉双友清，格韵真寒玉。\n伊谁与之友，相对淡无欲。\n清心仁智翁，妙趣于中足。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20574,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自讼","author":"陈淳","text":"气一志以动，志动气益狂。\n辗转互攻击，其端何有穷。\n哲人动知几，清明常在躬。\n私欲绝微萌，天真湛流通。\n表里皎如日，一隙无暧曚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20575,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西征铅山遇霜","author":"陈淳","text":"年来五十筋力衰，不耐风霜不耐雪。\n手为寒凋可铝磋，足为冻冽如刀切。\n泥泞跋涉负涂豕，硗确陟降蟠山鳖。\n攲行横行又跳行，忍痛忍饥复忍渴。\n此劳此苦岂再堪，焚舟之战惟一决。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20576,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过武夷","author":"陈淳","text":"武夷山下几回过，未暇于中赏一遭。\n狮鹤诸仙知我意，故将青霭淡遮罗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20577,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒居杂咏三十二首 其二 义","author":"陈淳","text":"义人之正路，中实存羞恶。\n要常由而行，不可离跬步。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20578,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒居杂咏三十二首 其三十 义维","author":"陈淳","text":"义以维其心，在心常有制。\n惟为理所宜，不徇情所利。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20579,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒居杂咏三十二首 其十六 口","author":"陈淳","text":"口所以司言，所言必正说。\n非法谨勿道，道之为噬噎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20580,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒居杂咏三十二首 其一 仁","author":"陈淳","text":"仁人之安宅，在心本全德。\n要常处于中，不可违终食。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20581,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒居杂咏三十二首 其十一 夫妇","author":"陈淳","text":"夫妇亦大端，乾男而坤女。\n一言在有别，不可欲败度。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20582,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒居杂咏三十二首 其十九 心","author":"陈淳","text":"心为形之君，所主一身政。\n持养常清明，百体皆顺令。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20583,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒居杂咏三十二首 其九 父子","author":"陈淳","text":"父子本天性，人伦此其大。\n一言在有亲，不可薄厥爱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20584,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒居杂咏三十二首 其十二 兄弟","author":"陈淳","text":"兄长而弟幼，天属之羽翼。\n一言在有序，不可事私阅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20585,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒居杂咏三十二首 其二十九 礼维","author":"陈淳","text":"礼以维其心，在心无不敬。\n非此勿言动，非此勿视听。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20586,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒居杂咏三十二首 其二十七 迁善","author":"陈淳","text":"善者性所有，不可无诸躬。\n每见必勇迁，吾德乃可崇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20587,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒居杂咏三十二首 其十 君臣","author":"陈淳","text":"君臣本大分，天尊而地卑。\n一言在有义，不可以为利。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20588,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒居杂咏三十二首 其二十八 改过","author":"陈淳","text":"过者动之差，毋容实诸己。\n才觉必速改，乃不为吾累。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20589,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒居杂咏三十二首 其十八 足","author":"陈淳","text":"足所以司履，所履必正道。\n邪径谨勿由，由之为躄跛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20590,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒居杂咏三十二首 其二十一 审问","author":"陈淳","text":"物理本不齐，杂然各异分。\n参伍宁无疑，要在审所问。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20591,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒居杂咏三十二首 其七 忠","author":"陈淳","text":"忠以尽诸己，其中不容伪。\n一毫苟自欺，在我先有愧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20592,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]